                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An entertaining, short & cheap mobile puzzle game. You have to put out fires before they spread, opening the path for dwellers to escape the building under a time pressure. In the \"catch the Pyro\" stage, you have to quench the fires while chasing a bad guy.\n\nThe Linux port was fine, except that it was not unlocking achievements for me. I played it via Proton and the achievements worked. The achievements are little bit messy, btw, since it is not clear what you must do and there are no guides. Some of the achievements have been acquired only by 6 people (well, now 7 with yours truly) and the 3 of them who replied couldn't tell me how they got it [spoiler]Geralt: hmmmm[/spoiler] The developer helped me, though and here are some explanations if you need: \nhttps://steamcommunity.com/app/437180/discussions/0/343788552544564007/\n\n",
